{"id":10975855395,"name":"Korrupt Zombies","desc":"New lobby system! Unlock skin crates and matchmake easier with the terminal system and new UI.\n\nKorrupt Zombies is a CoD Zombies-inspired round-based survival game. Team up with friends and fight off hordes of zombies on iconic maps with a huge arsenal of weapons. Experience breathtaking visuals and the most realistic graphics in the genre.\n\n- Play on iconic maps like Five, Nacht and Town\n- Discover easter eggs and find the Mystery Box, Pack-a-Punch, and more\n- Massive arsenal of guns and 3 wonder weapons (Ray Gun, Winter's Howl, Thunder Gun)\n- Upgrade your loadout with attachments and perks to enhance your firepower and survivability\n- Customize your weapons with skins and cosmetics\n- Grind and unlock exclusive camos \n\n--// Available on Mobile, PC and Console \\\\--\n\n[P] to access settings and keybinds\n\nDeveloped by: Axillary Studios\nPublished by: Roforco","path":"/game/10975855395-korrupt-zombies","slug":"10975855395-korrupt-zombies","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9040abfffcf9cd3f399c9b16c83557c5d1e83e93e8721dc5ec55777af3276a8d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ae90bd7248c8766d3c4c6b7cfbb998af/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":65,"visitor":36721204,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-28T15:57:46.077Z","creator":{"name":"Axillary Studios: Korrupt Zombies","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"2x-XP!-Korrupt-Zombies-SilentLock-Silent-Aim-GUI-70169","_id":"69266e9ee01d538f8b76bb93","title":"SilentLock  Silent Aim GUI","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77e64","gameId":10975855395,"name":"Korrupt Zombies","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":10975855395},"features":"✅ Fonctionnalités (v2.1 Fly update) :\n\n* Silent Aim full headshot quand tu maintiens clic droit 🎯\n* Lock caméra automatique sur la tête des zombies (dossier **Zombies** uniquement) 📌\n* Système de target “smart” : ignore les cadavres, switch auto sur le prochain zombie vivant ⚙️\n* FOV custom avec slider + cercle visible à l’écran 🌀\n* Toggle ON/OFF depuis un beau menu violet (style UI moderne) 💻\n* Mode Fly intégré (W/A/S/D + Space / Ctrl pour monter / descendre) 🚀\n* Affichage du pseudo + branding Ｒ¥乙乇メ directement dans l’interface ✨\n* Raycast et checks de vie optimisés pour limiter au max les lags 🧠\n\n📌 Infos :\nScript optimisé pour **Korrupt Zombies v2.1 (SilentLock + Fly)**, peut nécessiter une mise à jour après certains patchs du jeu.\nSupport, updates et suggestions sur le Discord : **[http://discord.gg/WnQDb7SUQt]** 💬\n\n✅ Features (v2.1 Fly Update):\n\n* Full headshot Silent Aim while holding right mouse button 🎯\n* Automatic camera lock on zombie heads (only targets models in **Zombies** folder) 📌\n* Smart target system: ignores dead bodies, auto-switches to the next alive zombie ⚙️\n* Custom FOV with slider + visible FOV circle on screen 🌀\n* Toggle ON/OFF from a clean purple modern UI menu 💻\n* Built-in Fly mode (W/A/S/D + Space / Ctrl to go up / down) 🚀\n* Shows your username + Ｒ¥乙乇メ branding directly in the interface ✨\n* Optimized raycast and health checks to reduce lag as much as possible 🧠\n\n📌 Info:\nScript optimized for **Korrupt Zombies v2.1 (SilentLock + Fly)**, may require updates after some game patches.\nSupport, updates and suggestions on Discord: **[http://discord.gg/WnQDb7SUQt]** 💬","tags":["op","best","gui","sigma","exploits"],"script":"https://link-center.net/1441445/x5OzfGcwnuBv","owner":{"_id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3","username":"ryzex_7k","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/32750eb6ea495f2ad03f62708109e22086405bfddac8710815d100a2b1e798dc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3-1790951312868.png"},"status":"offline","id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3","top